  "model": "openai/text-embedding-3-small",
  "input": "Which note records the decision that certificate expiry will alert 30 days ahead, and when was it written?\n[2025-08-07] incident-review/INC-2025-017: INC-2025-017 review. What happened: auth-gateway rejected every login for 12 minutes on 2025-08-02. Why: an expired intermediate certificate. Follow-up decision: certificate expiry will alert 30 days ahead, because an expired intermediate certificate took logins down in INC-2025-017. [2026-01-30] standup/cinder/2026-01-30: We agreed today that auth-gateway tokens will expire after 15 minutes instead of an hour. The reason is that the security audit flagged long-lived tokens. [2025-07-29] standup/ember/2025-07-29: Policy: every auth-gateway change requires two reviewer approvals and a security sign-off.",
